From 2a95671bc90ef5038b612bc781bf99be95ce1c59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:45:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Reuse isolated Board seeds for fake release matrices

Why: repeated fresh SQLite schema setup drove the 617-case rejection suite past its unchanged 300s file cap. Build one real create/push seed and deep-copy it per fake-only case; keep integration databases and every existing parameter/assertion.

Proof: canonical original 617 cases pass in 55.4s; 619 with isolation controls pass in 51.4s. Baseline 72-case slice costs 41.3s. Removing deepcopy kills both isolation controls. Independent precommit review approved.
---
 .../hermes_cli/test_kanban_sync_rejections.py | 109 ++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 76 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)

